> used {to'e ne'i} before, on more than one occasion.

Yes, it's useful. However, it doesn't help for "walk out of the forest". 
The thing tagged by {te'i} or {to'e ne'i} doesn't talk about where you 
are coming from. I've used {to'o ne'i} "away from inside": mi cadzu to'o 
ne'i lo ricfoi.

mu'o mi'e la selpa'i

